{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/039-quan-shui/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/039-quan-shui/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/data.json","title":"毛詩注疏 · 泉水 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 邶風 · 泉水 · 汇集《毛詩注疏》关于《泉水》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"039-quan-shui","materialId":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/039-quan-shui/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","poem":{"id":"039-quan-shui","title":"泉水","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"beifeng","path":["風","邶風","泉水"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"毖彼泉水","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"亦流于淇","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"有懷于衛","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"靡日不思","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"孌彼諸姬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"聊與之謀","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"出宿于泲","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"飲餞于禰","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"女子有行","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"遠父母兄弟","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"問我諸姑","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"遂及伯姊","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"出宿于干","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"飲餞于言","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"載脂載舝","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"還車言邁","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"遄臻于衛","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"不瑕有害","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"我思肥泉","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"茲之永嘆","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"思須與漕","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-022","text":"我心悠悠","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-023","text":"駕言出遊","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-024","text":"以寫我憂","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","title":"毛詩注疏","authors":["毛亨","鄭氏","孔穎達"],"contributorLine":"漢唐 · 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","era":"漢唐","publicationYear":653,"carrier":"TXT"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"毖彼泉水亦流于淇有懷于衛靡日不思孌彼諸姬聊與之謀出宿于泲飲餞于禰女子有行遠父母兄弟問我諸姑遂及伯姊出宿于干飲餞于言載脂載舝還車言邁遄臻于衛不瑕有害我思肥泉茲之永嘆思須與漕我心悠悠駕言出遊以寫我憂","targetNotes":"毛亨注述《泉水》歸寧與衣服之義。","sourceLabel":"第 39-41 页","sourceNotes":"依据 materials/searchable/kanseki/毛诗注疏_汉_毛亨_卷一_KR1c0004.txt 中 pb:KR1c0004_WYG_001-39b..KR1c0004_WYG_001-41b 的段落。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"毛亨","sectionLabel":"注","text":"毛亨以春秋、左傳與正義為據，從“毖彼泉水”“遠父母兄弟”“遂及伯姊”“思須與漕”幾句詩詞，說明《泉水》所問正是歸寧禮法：父母在世可歸寧，父母既沒後惟卿大夫以下得歸宗，而天子諸侯之妻因為恐其專恣而被禁歸寧，即便卿大夫之妻父母既沒仍可歸宗報昆弟。又從“孌彼諸姬”“載脂載舝”“還車言邁”“遄臻于衛”“不瑕有害”等句意，借“私服”“公服”“三狄之服”之例討論澣濯之道，指出不論公私衣服都要澣濯，詩人設問只是引出毛亨之答，而不是要分出公服私服孰潔。","notes":null}]}]}}}
